knows that Kurumi is infamously called the \"Worst Spirit,\" but the girl standing before him is a gentle soul. However, as the day draws to a close, Shidou finally begins to understand the truth behind it all.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: Unaired 11th episode of the TV series bundled with the third volume of Date A Live Encore.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 1, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIGHT_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 91, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Harem", "rank": 77, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Clone", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 72, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Teen Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tsundere", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20769, "title": {"romaji": "No Game No Life Mini OVAs", "english": "No Game No Life Specials"}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Specials included on the Blu-ray/DVD volumes.", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 11}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 6, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIGHT_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Ecchi", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Nudity", "rank": 82, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Episodic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 74, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chibi", "rank": 60, "isAdult": fal