OVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Cute Girls Doing Cute Things", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Chuunibyou", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School Club", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20779, "title": {"romaji": "Kyoukai no Kanata #0 Shinonome", "english": "Beyond the Boundary: Daybreak"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Bundled with seventh Blu-ray/DVD volume of  <i>Kyoukai no Kanata</i>.<br>\n<br>\nEpisode 0 happens three years prior to the TV series when the Nase siblings meet Akihito for the first time in a mission for Hiroomi. Mitsuki follows her brother on this mission and their goal is to subjugate Akihito.", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 1, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIGHT_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Fantasy", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Super Power", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 56, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Demons", "rank": 44, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Rural", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20781, "title": {"romaji": "Kono Danshi, Sekika ni Nayandemasu.", "english": "This Boy Suffers from Crystallization"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "The story revolves around high school boy Ayumu Banri, who has an illness that makes him start to turn to stone when he's stressed. Since he couldn't fit in with his class, after repeating a year, he declared that he wanted to have a \"Sparkly youth\" as well. To do this, he changed his hair and clothes to be more fashionable, and constantly checked for popular topics to stay in the know. In the midst of Ayumu's life of making a facade, his homeroom teacher and stone-loving geology teacher Kouya Onihara says that Ayumu's stone transformation is beautiful. Ayumu begins to become attracted to Kouya, who starts to give him advice.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 1, "duration": 28, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#konodan", "genres": ["Fantasy", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Age Gap", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Disability", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Teacher", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20782, "title": {"romaji": "Barakamon: Mijikamon", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Short specials for Barakamon, including Episode 0, airing on the official YouTube channel before every regular episode.", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 9}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 13, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Chibi", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Meta", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Rural", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Mixed Media", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Iyashikei", "rank": 10, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20786, "title": {"romaji": "Appleseed α", "english": "Appleseed Alpha"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Appleseed Alpha depicts the early days of Deunan Knute and Briareos in the 22nd century, as they embark on a journey throughout dystopic ruins of New York in search of the city of Olympus. They are hired by Two Horns, the warlord of the ruined city, to eliminate bipedal combat machines. During the fight, they encouter Iris and Olson, both on a mission. Deunan and Briareos befriend with them and decide to join their mission.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIris is tasked with preventing the malevolent cyborg Talos from capturing a secret weapon humans were building. Talos uses Iris to activate the gigantic war machine.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n(Source: Wikipedia)", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 1, "duration": 93, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Mecha", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Military", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Police", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Robots", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyborg", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dystopian", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Seinen", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 20787, "title": {"romaji": "Chain Chronicle: Short Animation", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "An anime adaptation of the game for mobile devices Chain Chronicle.<br>\n<br>\nFeatures eight short episodes that introduces the story, setting, and characters.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2014, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2014, "episodes": 8, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Magic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "War", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Elf", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Nekomimi", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Archery", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dragons", "ran